{
  "id": "06064_yosousuru",
  "headword": "{予想|よそう}する",
  "reading": "よそうする",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (suru)",
  "gloss": "to predict, to anticipate",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to predict, to expect, to anticipate",
      "explanation": "To form an idea or opinion about what will happen in the future based on current information."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "06064_yosousuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{結果|けっか}を{予想|よそう}するのは{難|むずか}しい。",
      "english": "It's difficult to predict the outcome.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06064_yosousuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{予想|よそう}したとおりになった。",
      "english": "It turned out just as I expected.",
      "notes": "Common expression",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06064_yosousuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{予想|よそう}を{上回|うわまわ}る{売上|うりあげ}だった。",
      "english": "Sales exceeded expectations.",
      "notes": "Uses noun form",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06064_yosousuru_ex4",
      "japanese": "{予想|よそう}に{反|はん}して、{試合|しあい}は{接戦|せっせん}になった。",
      "english": "Contrary to expectations, the match became a close game.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06064_yosousuru_ex5",
      "japanese": "{地震|じしん}がいつ{起|お}こるか{予想|よそう}するのは{現在|げんざい}の{技術|ぎじゅつ}では{不可能|ふかのう}だ。",
      "english": "Predicting when an earthquake will occur is impossible with current technology.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Pattern: Xを{予想|よそう}する (predict/expect X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates state. {予想|よそう}している = 'expects' or 'is predicting.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{予想|よそう}どおり (as expected)\n・{予想|よそう}に{反|はん}して (contrary to expectations)\n・{予想|よそう}を{上回|うわまわ}る/{下回|したまわ}る (exceed/fall short of expectations)\n・{予想|よそう}{外|がい} (unexpected)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS: {予測|よそく}する is more formal/scientific; {予想|よそう}する is more general.",
